  "problem": "A billiard ball is projected vertically downward with an initial velocity of $0.25\\,\\text{m/s}$ and hits the ground after $0.025$ minutes. Find the distance the billiard ball covered during its fall. **Do not round your answer**.\n\n*Hint: The acceleration due to gravity is $9.8\\,{\\text{m/s}}^{2}.$*\n\nDuring its fall, the billiard ball covered a distance of\n{{field-1}}$\\text{m}.$",
